// Name :
// LocationString :
// ProfessionString :
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P533269528" "Scratch"
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P1354027233" "Another Fan letter?! I gotta say this time of year is the worst. So many girls wanting me to scratch that itch, I can't keep up. I keep telling them, without a full body shot I don't reply to these things. Thanks for delivering this, {HeroName}, but this poor girl doesn't fit the bill. If you want to keep that CD, go ahead, otherwise toss it in the pile over there next to the trashcan..."
// WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P3275446462" "Cross Cut"
// WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P20313183" "Oh you naughty girl! You watched me do that? That just isn't fair that you get to see me play and I don't get to include you.<br><br>I inspire you, hmmm? Well, your <i>enthusiasm</i> inspires me to want to collaborate. I think I'll find this little dish and see if she'd join me for dinner, you know, to chew the fat, so to speak..."
// VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P1280824502" "You find a scuffed and scratched up music CD jewel case with a moderately competent piece of cover art. Inside the case is recordable CD labeled <i>Party Beats 2000</i> on it with a hand written sticky note that reads:"
// VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P4083229795" "<i>OMG! You are the best ever! Don't want to sound like a stalker but I saw you perform in that warehouse in the Rogue Isles and it <u>blew my mind</u>. I just had to show you how you made me feel so I made you this mix. It Highlights a lot of things I was going through at the time. I hope when you listen to it, it inspires you as much as you inspire me.<br>- A Huge Admirer Of Your Work</i><br><br>The penmanship and hearts dotting 'I's and 'J's tells you this admirer is a woman, probably in her mid 20s given the date on the CD label. Listening to the music you realize that this girl is obsessed with the artist, Scratch, one of DJ Zero's fellow musical mix masters. However, the dark and gritty themes of the selected songs that make up the mix remind you of angst ridden suffering the likes of which nobody could truly feel, that is, unless they were under the careful attention of the individual known as Cross Cut. Perhaps he could show this girl a thing or two about pain and suffering, and the price of thinking either is cool."
// SENDER_NAME :
"P453183900" "A Huge Admirer Of Your Work"
// VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P3619888581" "This CD jewel case contains a personalized mix tape for Scratch from an admirer of his work. However, the themes present in Scratch's work remind you of Cross Cut, and you wonder if it wouldn't be poetic to introduce this girl to a physical manifestation of what she thinks is 'hip and cool'."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
// ContactRequiresText :
