// VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P3040050249" "You come across a letter, yellowed with age and wrapped in a rough leather pouch. It reads:"
// VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P2049789175" "I never deserved you... I never deserved anything which I've received... But I know one day I will live on, and you may not. Your brother seeks to find immortality for his love. I shall not dishonor you by attempting the same. Let's enjoy this Valentine's Day and all the rest, knowing each is precious."
// SENDER_NAME :
"P3124745956" "Marcus Cole"
// VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P2599303574" "This Valentine is a simple letter, though well protected from the elements. It looks old enough to belong in a museum."
// UNDELIVERABLE_EXPLANATION :
